{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51244","headline":"归隐 · 元德秀","name":"归隐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"缓步巾车出鲁山，陆浑佳处处恣安闲。\n家无仆妾饥忘爨，自有琴书兴不阑。\n（《古今图书集成·职方典》四八八《汝州部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元德秀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51244.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51244","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}